{
  "key": 20371,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "This area is great for fishing. You\n",
        "can see loads of Water-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Do you like Water-type Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00001",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00002",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "That TM contains Water Pulse!\r",
        "It pairs well with any Water\n",
        "Pokémon you might come across."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": "Oh. That’s rather disappointing..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "When you want to go fishing,\n",
        "face the water and use the Rod first.\r",
        "Then concentrate and look closely\n",
        "at the water!\r",
        "An “!” appears when a Pokémon\n",
        "has taken a bite!\r",
        "Press the A Button quickly to pull back\n",
        "on the line.\r",
        "You’ll see what happens next.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "What should I make my Pokémon hold?\r",
        "Maybe an item that increases\n",
        "its Attack power..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Bonjour.\n",
        "How are you?\f",
        "Are you picking Apricorns? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Way to go, little Apricorn collector!\r",
        "I feel so great, I want to give\n",
        "you this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "How come? What a waste!\r",
        "I will show you how great\n",
        "Apricorns are!\r",
        "Take this first.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Lure Ball!\n",
        "This Poké Ball makes it easy to catch\f",
        "the Pokémon that appear when you\f",
        "go fishing!\r",
        "Actually, this is made from Apricorns.\n",
        "Consider those two as small gifts\f",
        "from me.\r",
        "If you want more, go to Azalea Town.\n",
        "A man called Kurt can make special\f",
        "Poké Balls out of Apricorns.\r",
        "Apricorns rule!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Kurt is the hero of every Apricorn\n",
        "collector out there.\r",
        "If you are to go to Azalea Town,\n",
        "be sure to visit him.\r",
        "Apricorn, Apricornier, Apricorniest!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "This area is great for fishing.\n",
        "Looking at all those people fishing,\f",
        "did you feel like you wanted to try\f",
        "fishing, too?\r",
        "Do you like fishing, lass?{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00013",
      "en_US": "Wooper: Upah!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0381_R32PC0101_00014",
      "en_US": "Fantastic! You should take this TM!\r"
    }
  ]
}
